SUMMARY:No More Waiting! Trust and Enjoy Your Own Path to Success
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nDeep down you know
  you’re meant to have the most wonderful life of your dreams. Eternal ha
 ppiness is what you’re created for\; you need and desire this in a livin
 g loving Universe that wants you to be a healthy functioning part of it\, 
 just like you want every organ of your body to be healthy functioning too.
  So what are you waiting for? Well\, in a word\, beliefs. Belief systems a
 re your expectation-based models of reality that will imprison you or set 
 you free.\n\nMost people are waiting for something to first get better in 
 their life\, then they will be happier. They believe they need more money\
 , love\, health\, world peace\, something\, and then they will do what the
 y enjoy. But waiting is a trap\, because beliefs don’t change by themsel
 ves\, they only progress. That’s why the world has gotten so much worse 
 just when we thought it should have gotten better by now. The need and des
 ire are growing for a deep change that will never start outside of the sel
 f. A problem still out there is only a mirror that says we still haven’t
  changed.\n\nJoin us this Sunday July 26\, 2026 for a free mind-unlocking 
 talk on how to rethink your approach to life so you can be the happiness t
 hat leads rather than follows reality. There’s nothing wrong with having
  reactions to the outer world\, the problem comes with reacting endlessly.
  This is what most people do as they wait for reality to do what they want
 . Their waiting doesn’t have to look weak and passive\, as many people a
 re very active with impressive busywork that will never succeed. For examp
 le\, many people are actively fighting to change the world and other peopl
 e\, which fails because that’s just not how life works. Your personal li
 festyle is your control panel on a reality that’s matching you by the la
 w of attraction. So rising pain and frustration show that you need more ha
 ppy emotions from changed beliefs. But most people just feed their same be
 lief-based feelings back into the same actions as they blame reality for n
 ot reacting differently to them. That’s like expecting darkness to becom
 e light if we just curse it enough.\n\nThe key to change is using our emot
 ions to start doing what succeeds instead of what fails. This doesn’t me
 an a simple opposite\, such as getting mad at ourselves instead of getting
  mad at other people. Flip-flopping between two extremes when neither work
 s is a characteristic of stubborn negativity. “Well I’m trying somethi
 ng different\, now I’m yelling at myself after yelling at other people\,
  that should get results!” Of course that’s silly\, because the emotio
 n of anger has been linked to the same action which fails on principle. Fa
 lse beliefs say that threatening the right person will bring change\, and 
 then more false beliefs say that getting a reaction is a change. But react
 ions just unconsciously grow the same pattern\, while responses are the co
 nscious relinking of emotions and actions for a real change in the system.
  For example\, anger can lead to an entirely different action from yelling
 \, including finding a belief to change.\n\nThere are four basic emotional
 ly driven survival reactions\, in which people falsely believe that a cert
 ain emotional behavior will make their situation change to give them diffe
 rent emotions. But their emotions are the situational pattern\, so they’
 re really stuck In their own feedback loop with false beliefs telling them
  things will get better when they can’t possibly. False beliefs lie this
  way\, keeping people stuck in pain waiting for happiness. True beliefs ex
 plain how the Universe really works so you can use your emotions to fuel n
 ew behaviors that feel better right away. No more waiting for a change to 
 happen. You’re the creator of changes you enjoy by choosing beliefs that
  work for you starting now. Learn to take SIPS: steps of incrementally pre
 destined success.\n\nFor this meetup\, think about what changes you’ve b
 een waiting for all your life. Notice the emotions that you get stuck in r
 epeatedly\, and how sick and tired you are of the problems that don’t go
  away. Promise to yourself that you will find the answers to get better fi
 nally. We’ll compare the false beliefs of domination versus the true bel
 iefs of dominion\, in which you have your own unique path of success. We
 ’ll look at patterns of popular dysfunction that keep people stuck\, ver
 sus the future of spiritual freedom in which you can always be happy. We
 ’ll conclude with a guided meditation to strengthen the human spirit par
 tnership\, so the experiencing and deciding sides of your being can learn 
 from your higher self who has all the answers you’ve been needing.\n\nWe
 lcome! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group is free online eve
 ry Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided meditatio
 n. If you can’t stay you can get the recording. You can signup here for 
 this meeting and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, vid
 eos\, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mast
 ery\nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at [www.signupISM.com](h
 ttp://www.signupISM.com)
