SUMMARY:Ballroom Workshops with Coach in Residency Lori Woods-Gay (Limited
  to 20 Slots)
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nJoin us for a focu
 sed Ballroom training series with resident coach Lori Woods-Gay! Tradition
 al figures are broken down into essential movement components — building
  muscle memory\, balance\, and control before layering in partnering\, mus
 icality\, and artistic expression.\n📅 Schedule (6:00–6:50 PM):\n\n* J
 uly 27 – Partnering\n* Aug. 3 – Arm Styling\n* Aug. 17 – Leg Lines\n
 \n⚠️ Limited to 20 students — RSVP early!\nBook your spot: [https://
 www.eventbrite.com/e/workshops-with-coach-in-residency-lori-woods-gay-limi
 ted-to-20-slots-tickets-1993797316445?aff=oddtdtcreator](https://www.event
 brite.com/e/workshops-with-coach-in-residency-lori-woods-gay-limited-to-20
 -slots-tickets-1993797316445?aff=oddtdtcreator)
