SUMMARY:Dinner at Craft Public House
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nDinner at Craft Pu
 blic House\n\nSaturday\, August 1st\, 7pm\n\n1040 Tryon Village Dr Ste 601
 Cary\, NC 27518 (919) 851 9173 https://www.craftpublichouse.com/\n\nOrgani
 zer: Dwen Andrews dwencita@gmail.com 919 624 0762 / 919 244 2710 LE2615\nC
 raft Public House in Cary\, NC\, is a restaurant that specializes in scrat
 ch-made dishes using local and seasonal products. At Craft Public House\, 
 great food brings people together. Craft restaurant blends elevated pub fa
 re and comfort food classics with a welcoming\, relaxed atmosphere that’
 s perfect for our group.\n​\nEnjoy familiar favorites with a creative tw
 ist\, attentive service\, and an experience that’s as comfortable as it 
 is memorable. Whether you’re a local regular or a first-time guest\, the
 re’s always something worth savoring at Craft.
